 . Through guided conversations\, rotations and interactive connection roun
 ds\, you'll meet a variety of new people — even if you're coming alone.\
 n\nThis time\, we're meeting at Afro's Pizza at STACKT Market\, one of dow
 ntown Toronto's distinctive food and culture destinations.\n\n✨ Themed C
 onnection Rounds\nAfter meeting different people through Fast Friends\, we
 'll introduce a few fun interactive rounds designed to help you discover c
 ommon interests — from travel and food to music\, fitness\, books and mo
 re.\nIt's an easy way to find the people you genuinely click with and keep
  the best conversations going.\n\n🎟️ Book Early & Save: [https://toro
 29thaug.eventbrite.co.uk](https://toro29thaug.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bir
 d: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nAt the Door: CAD $20 cash\nAdvance tickets a
 re cheaper and help us plan the right group size and reserved space for th
 e best experience.\n\n🕖 What to Expect\n7:00 PM — Welcome & Introduct
 ions\nMeet your host Elena\, settle in and get comfortable. Coming alone? 
 Perfect — most guests do.\n7:30–8:30 PM — Hosted Fast Friends\nMeet 
 a new person every few minutes through short\, guided conversations. Your 
 host keeps the evening flowing so you always know what to do and who you'l
 l meet next.\nFrom 8:30 PM — Find Your People & Socialise\nReconnect wit
 h the people you clicked with\, discover shared interests and continue the
  conversations naturally over food and drinks.\n\n❤️ Why You'll Love I
 t\n✔️ Meet 15–20+ new people in one evening\n✔️ Professionally h
 osted conversations and rotations\n✔️ Interactive Themed Connection Ro
 unds\n✔️ Most guests attend solo\n✔️ Reserved space exclusively fo
 r our group\n✔️ Members from our 7 Toronto Meetup communities may also
  attend\n✔️ Unique downtown setting at STACKT Market\n✔️ Detroit-s
 tyle pizza from Afro's Pizza\n✔️ Halal options available\n✔️ Desig
 ned for ladies and gents aged 25–45\n\n📍 Good to Know\nAfro's Pizza a
 t STACKT Market\n28 Bathurst St\, Toronto\nSTACKT Market is a well-known d
 owntown destination combining food\, drinks\, culture and community experi
 ences\, making it an easy and distinctive place to meet up.\nMost people a
 ttend alone\, so you won't be the only one arriving solo.\n\nMembers from 
 our other 6 Toronto Meetup communities may also join\, so the final group 
