 ommon Ground Challenge to discover shared interests\n✔ Easy board games 
 & socialising after the hosted rounds\n✔ Relaxed pub setting\n✔ Friend
 ship-focused — not a dating event\n\n👥 Who Is This For?\n✔ Ages 25
